# Weatherglass Shoal (CIPlay weatherglass_shoal): a side shoal at sea level; the station, the weather log, the barometer,
# the station chest and the twin note.
island Weatherglass Shoal
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Weatherglass
zone station
expect step 1
read Weather log
expect step 2
use barometer
expect story reading 1
expect step 3
open Station chest
wait 3
expect step 4
read Twin note
expect done
